      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ARCHIE'S GIFT (6) rocketed out of the boxes with a strong early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when second (22.56) at Geelong over 400m. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Rates highly and will give a great sight. FRANKY'S LASS (2) was a winner two back when prominent throughout then got further back last time and could manage only a 7 length 4th at Geelong (22.99). Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from six attempts. Expected to feature in the finish. BORDER BEAST (4) stalked the lead and fought on well to finish 3 lengths away in second (23.56) at Horsham in a Grade 5 over 410m. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with two wins from three starts. Can measure up. TRISSA BALE (8) will give backers a sight.",
